Zumzum uses, without bundling them:
- NumPy (BSD-3-Clause) and SciPy (BSD-3-Clause);
- soundfile (BSD-3-Clause), which loads libsndfile (LGPL-2.1, shipped with soundfile's own packages, not with Zumzum);
- matplotlib (PSF-based Matplotlib licence), for review sheets;
- pytest (MIT), for the tests.

The example audio is not part of this repository. tools/fetch_audio.py downloads public domain and CC0 recordings
from Wikimedia Commons, each checked by SHA-256; examples/sources.json lists each source, author and licence.
